{"name":"Giant Carnivorous Plant","size":"huge","type":"plant","tag":"","alignment":"neutral evil","hitDice":"20","armorName":"none","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":5,"otherArmorDesc":"14","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":true,"hpText":"170 (20d12 + 40)","speedDesc":"0m","strPoints":"19","dexPoints":"14","conPoints":"15","intPoints":"8","wisPoints":"7","chaPoints":"3","blindsight":"0","blind":true,"darkvision":"0","tremorsense":"20","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"2","customCr":"1 (200 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The monster can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The monster regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the monster can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the monster can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The monster can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the monster's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the monster's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the monster dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Grappler","desc":"The [MON] has advantage on attack rolls against any creature grappled by it."}],"actions":[{"name":"Multiattack","desc":"The [MON] makes three attacks: two with its vines and one with its mouth, or three with its vines. If the [MON] has fewer than half of its hp remaining, it makes only two attacks instead."},{"name":"Vines","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 5m, one target. _Hit:_ [STR 1D4] piercing damage. The target is grappled (escape dc [STR SAVE]). The target is poisoned until the grapple ends, taking [CON 1D4] acid damage at the start his turn."},{"name":"Bite","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 5m, one target. _Hit:_ [DEX 1D6] piercing damage. The target is grappled (escape dc [STR SAVE]). Until this grapple ends, the target is restrained, and the [MON] can't bite another target."},{"name":"Swallow","desc":"The [MON] makes one bite attack against a Medium or smaller target it is grappling. If the attack hits, the target is swallowed, and the grapple ends. The swallowed target is blinded and restrained, it has total cover against attacks and other effects outside the [MON], and it takes  [CON 2D4] acid damage at the start of each of the [MON]'s turns. The [MON] can have only 3 target swallowed at a time. If the [MON] dies, a swallowed creature is no longer restrained by it and can escape from the corpse using 3m of movement, exiting prone."},{"name":"Acid Eruption","desc":"_Ranged Spell Attack:_ [CON ATK] to hit, range 12m, all targets in range. _Hit:_ A 12m eruption of acid spit shoots from [MON]'s mouth and affects the entire surrounding area. Each creature in range must make a Constitution saving throw (DC [CON SAVE]). A target takes [CON 3D6] acid damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. The ground is now acidic. Any creature that starts its turn on the ground must succeed on a Constitution saving throw (DC [CON SAVE]) or take [CON 1d4] acid damage."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[{"name":"Parry","desc":"Once per turn, the [MON], using his vines, adds 4 to its AC against one melee attack that would hit it. To do so, the attacker must be closer than 3 meters from the [MON]. If the attacker's attack fails, the [MON] can perform a free Vines attack."},{"name":"Little Vines","desc":"If a creature ends its turn within 2 meters of a little vine, that vine can perform a free Vines attack. The little vine has 8 (1d12 + 2) hp."}],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[{"name":"str","order":0}],"skills":[],"damagetypes":[{"name":"acid","note":" (Immune)","type":"i"}],"specialdamage":[{"name":"fire (x4)","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"}],"conditions":[],"languages":[],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"carnivorous plant","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":3,"damage":[]}